OL,3,GNEWSASecond man charged with murder
OL,4,Aafter house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following a fatal house fire in
OL,8,Fwest London last week, the Metropolitan
OL,9,FPolice have said.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fproperty on Berkeley Avenue in Hounslow
OL,13,Fat about 01:15 BST on 19 August
OL,14,Ffollowing reports of a fire. Nine
OL,15,Fpeople were taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
