OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASecond man charged with murder
OL,4,Aafter house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna Kowalska, 50, died in hospital,
OL,7,Fand a 40-year-old woman remains in
OL,8,Fhospital in a life-threatening
OL,9,Fcondition. The remaining seven people -
OL,10,Fsix men and one woman - have since been
OL,11,Fdischarged after receiving treatment
OL,12,Ffor minor injuries.
OL,14,FSlawomir Alama, 41, of Bath Road,
OL,15,FHounslow, has been charged with murder
OL,16,Fand eight counts of attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
